  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Pobrecita the Dog</h1>
    <p>Small paws. Big heart. Infinite zoomies.</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#stats">Stats</a>
    <a href="#schedule">Schedule</a>
    <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
    <a href="#fun">Fun Facts</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section id="about" class="hero-card">
      <div class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">🐕</div>
      <p class="tagline">
        Pobrecita may look like she’s having a ruff day, but she’s actually the happiest pup on the block.
        Rescued, adored, and always ready for a belly rub.
      </p>
      <div class="action-bar">
        <button class="btn-primary" onclick="giveTreat()">🦴 Give a Treat</button>
        <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="bark()">🔊 Hear a Bark</button>
      </div>
      <p id="treat-counter" style="margin-top:1rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--color-brown);">
        Treats received: 0
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="stats">
      <h2>📋 Pobrecita’s Profile</h2>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat"><strong>3</strong><span>Years Old</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><strong>Medium</strong><span>Size</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><strong>Chaotic</strong><span>Energy Level</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><strong>100%</strong><span>Good Girl</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="schedule">
      <h2>🗓️ Daily Schedule</h2>
      <ul class="schedule">
